        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #47777d;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(125deg,#1b4653,#14303e);padding:3.8cqw;color:#eff9f3;font-family:system-ui\"><div style=\"color:#e9b96d;letter-spacing:.16em;font:800 1.65cqw/1.2 system-ui\">TRY IT WITH YOUR AI</div><h2 style=\"font:600 4cqw/1.08 Georgia,serif;margin:1.5cqw 0\">Can your AI answer the Question?</h2><p style=\"color:#cce1dc;font:1.86cqw/1.4 system-ui;margin:0 0 1.5cqw\">Open this graph with your AI and say: <b>Run the Stockroom exercise in this graph.</b> It should read the Question and its answer contract, follow the six stages below, and work from the stockroom snapshot in this graph.</p><div style=\"color:#e9b96d;font:1.55cqw/1.35 system-ui\">If something it needs is missing, it should say BLOCKED. It should never invent a run.</div></div>"
        },
