        "title": "03 · Calculate reorder draft",
        "phase": "action",
        "instruction": "For each row validate nonnegative integers onHand, reserved, minimum and positive integer packSize, with reserved <= onHand. Only state=active rows qualify. available=onHand-reserved. If available < minimum, shortfall=minimum-available, packs=ceil(shortfall/packSize), orderUnits=packs*packSize. Sort qualifying SKUs ascending. Build exactly the JSON object described by the bound Question's answerSchema (and the Verification gate); do not add vendor notes, purchase orders or invented values. Work in memory only.",
        "inputs": "inventoryRows\nsourceEvidence\nrunId",
        "outputs": "candidateResult",
        "authority": "private-draft",
        "onFailure": "STOP. Report the precise blocker. Nothing is saved, so there is nothing to clean up.",
