        "gateType": "validation",
        "requirement": "Independently recompute from the rows you read in twilite-stockroom-exercise-snapshot. Reject duplicate SKUs; missing or invalid integer fields; negative available counts; any non-active SKU in orders; any omitted qualifying active SKU; any active SKU at/above minimum in orders; incorrect ceil pack rounding; unsorted output; incorrect totals; wrong snapshot or source. Candidate JSON MUST have exactly top-level fields schemaVersion, runId, snapshotId, sourceRef, orders, totalOrderSkus, totalOrderUnits, and every order exactly sku, available, shortfall, packSize, packs, orderUnits. schemaVersion = \"stockroom-reorder/v1\". sourceRef = \"twilite-stockroom-exercise-snapshot\". totalOrderSkus = number of orders; totalOrderUnits = sum(orderUnits). A saved gate decision is not evidence. If verification fails, STOP and report. Explicitly evaluate the bound Question's requiredEvidence and completion criterion. Report answerStatus=resolved only if ALL criteria pass; otherwise unresolved or blocked with missing evidence. A procedurally successful run is not proof of a resolved Question.",
