        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #446f76;border-radius:18px;background:#15323e;color:#e9f6f1;padding:3.3cqw;font-family:system-ui\"><div style=\"font:800 1.5cqw/1.2 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#e9b96d\">ANSWER / HAND-BACK</div><h2 style=\"font:600 3.4cqw/1.12 Georgia,serif;margin:1cqw 0 1.5cqw\">One answer, then one question to you.</h2><div style=\"color:#cee0dd;font:1.7cqw/1.4 system-ui\">A sorted JSON <b>orders</b> array with sku, available, shortfall, packSize, packs and orderUnits, plus schemaVersion, runId, snapshotId, sourceRef (always exactly <b>twilite-stockroom-exercise-snapshot</b>) and the two totals. Then the AI asks. Only after your yes does it give you a Result card to paste into this graph.</div></div>"
        },
