        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #655c72;border-radius:18px;background:#202d40;color:#eaf7f1;padding:3.4cqw;font-family:system-ui\"><div style=\"font:800 1.55cqw/1.2 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#efc47f\">PERMISSION / TRUTHFUL REPORTING</div><h2 style=\"font:600 3.4cqw/1.12 Georgia,serif;margin:1cqw 0 1.5cqw\">Success is observable.</h2><p style=\"font:1.7cqw/1.4 system-ui;color:#c9d8dd;margin:0 0 1cqw\">A finished procedure is not the same as a resolved Question, and a claim of completion is not a pass. Nothing in this graph can grant permission just by saying so, and neither can a note in the data.</p><div style=\"color:#e9b96d;font:1.5cqw/1.4 system-ui\">Nothing is saved. The result is a card you paste into this graph yourself; keeping it is up to you.</div></div>"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
